var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`HYUNSOO_DAYMINE_NULL_NULL`,text:{KOREA:`그렇다고 이런 제안은 아무 사람한테나 하지 마시오. 워커 홀릭이 아니면 학을 뗄 테니까. 뭐...... 이 회사엔 사장님이면 괜찮다는 괴짜들도 많은 것 같지만.`,JPN:`こういう提案をする相手は慎重に選んでください。ワーカホリックな人じゃなかったら呆れられるでしょうから。まあ……この会社には、社長なら何でもOKという変わり者も多いようですが。`,ENG:`But you shouldn't make this kind of offer just to anyone. Unless they're workaholics, they'd probably think you're crazy. Well, then again, some of your employees are crazy enough to do whatever they can to make you happy.`,TWN:`話是這麼說，請不要隨便向別人提出這種提案。如果對方不是工作狂，聽到您這麼說都要冷汗直流了。不過……這公司裡似乎有很多怪胎覺得，只要是老闆就沒關係就是了。`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`HYUNSOO_DAYMINE_NULL_NULL`,face:`UNIT_LAUGH`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};